  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "ns9gl3",
      "label": "Start",
      "bg": "bg uni.jpg",
      "music": "audio/illurock.opus",
      "events": [
        {
          "id": "l0310o",
          "type": "music",
          "music": "audio/illurock.opus"
        },
        {
          "id": "d40luj",
          "type": "bg",
          "bg": "bg lecturehall.jpg"
        },
        {
          "id": "t8j2pv",
          "type": "effect",
          "kind": "Fade",
          "dur": 0.5
        },
        {
          "id": "hi2v73",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "It's only when I hear the sounds of shuffling feet and supplies being put away that I realize that the lecture's over."
        },
        {
          "id": "638z6j",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Professor Eileen's lectures are usually interesting, but today I just couldn't concentrate on it."
        },
        {
          "id": "50r7in",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "I've had a lot of other thoughts on my mind...thoughts that culminate in a question."
        },
        {
          "id": "ryuwpk",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "It's a question that I've been meaning to ask a certain someone."
        },
        {
          "id": "ocn985",
          "type": "bg",
          "bg": "bg uni.jpg"
        },
        {
          "id": "npeg37",
          "type": "effect",
          "kind": "Fade",
          "dur": 0.5
        },
        {
          "id": "89xig0",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "When we come out of the university, I spot her right away."
        },
        {
          "id": "vkj5yn",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "sylvie green normal.png",
          "side": "center",
          "atl_code": "xoffset -582\nyoffset -60"
        },
        {
          "id": "81u97b",
          "type": "effect",
          "kind": "Dissolve",
          "dur": 0.5
        },
        {
          "id": "wab55y",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "I've known Sylvie since we were kids. She's got a big heart and she's always been a good friend to me."
        },
        {
          "id": "2yx8rfo0",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": null,
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "asdfhgaskijdehgfliakuwgherlfikauhwglef YOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO",
          "side": "center",
          "tpl_id": null
        },
        {
          "id": "l1wyw5",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "narrator: But recently... I've felt that I want something more."
        },
        {
          "id": "n5y2ev",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "More than just talking, more than just walking home together when our classes end."
        },
        {
          "id": "u6wcy2",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "As soon as she catches my eye, I decide...",
          "opts": [
            {
              "id": "ptpkpa",
              "text": "To ask her right away.",
              "scene": "c5anxc",
              "is_correct": true
            },
            {
              "id": "zimzik",
              "text": "To ask her later.",
              "scene": "nn5hep",
              "is_incorrect": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "aav7pk",
          "type": "jump",
          "scene_id": null,
          "_isReturn": true
        }
      ],
      "scene_ids": []
    },
    {
      "id": "c5anxc",
      "label": "Rway",
      "bg": "bg meadow.jpg",
      "music": null,
      "events": [
        {
          "id": "wf1xes",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "sylvie green smile.png",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "eq34et",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "11tg9uyk",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "Hi there! How was class?",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "5xnp53",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "i4j3r1am",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "Good...",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "4nwhi3",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "I can't bring myself to admit that it all went in one ear and out the other."
        },
        {
          "id": "46qb58",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "i4j3r1am",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "Are you going home now? Wanna walk back with me?",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "5xaw06",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "sylvie green smile.png",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "3pql3l",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "11tg9uyk",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "Sure!",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "e7whd8",
          "type": "bg",
          "bg": "bg meadow.jpg"
        },
        {
          "id": "61n1k0",
          "type": "effect",
          "kind": "Fade",
          "dur": 0.5
        },
        {
          "id": "pkd5if",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "After a short while, we reach the meadows just outside the neighborhood where we both live."
        },
        {
          "id": "e3km9m",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "It's a scenic view I've grown used to. Autumn is especially beautiful here."
        },
        {
          "id": "z1kjdd",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "When we were children, we played in these meadows a lot, so they're full of memories."
        },
        {
          "id": "a85xf8",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "i4j3r1am",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "Hey... Umm...",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "1ozm73",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "sylvie green smile.png",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "vb5w89",
          "type": "effect",
          "kind": "Dissolve",
          "dur": 0.5
        },
        {
          "id": "y03c7s",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "She turns to me and smiles. She looks so welcoming that I feel my nervousness melt away."
        },
        {
          "id": "rb1xee",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "I'll ask her...!"
        },
        {
          "id": "13clz5",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "i4j3r1am",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "Ummm... Will you...",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "fi8oj1",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "i4j3r1am",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "Will you be my artist for a visual novel?",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "ne3m2l",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "sylvie green surprised.png",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "aar1yj",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Silence."
        },
        {
          "id": "aje8xx",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "She looks so shocked that I begin to fear the worst. But then..."
        },
        {
          "id": "yzepxz",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "sylvie green smile.png",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "bh8jrw",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "Sure, but what's a \\\"visual novel\\\"?",
          "opts": [
            {
              "id": "erdbqb",
              "text": "It's a videogame.",
              "scene": "crd2p6"
            },
            {
              "id": "tdw7ao",
              "text": "It's an interactive book.",
              "scene": "68wp9a"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "yqyooj",
          "type": "jump",
          "scene_id": null,
          "_isReturn": true
        }
      ],
      "scene_ids": []
    },
    {
      "id": "crd2p6",
      "label": "Game",
      "bg": null,
      "music": null,
      "events": [
        {
          "id": "bcnzsj",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "i4j3r1am",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "It's a kind of videogame you can play on your computer or a console.",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "8ydlv9",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "i4j3r1am",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "Visual novels tell a story with pictures and music.",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "8nnt7b",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "i4j3r1am",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "Sometimes, you also get to make choices that affect the outcome of the story.",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "nr2xa3",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "sylvie green smile.png",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "h9kot8",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "11tg9uyk",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "So it's like those choose-your-adventure books?",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "d65is1",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "i4j3r1am",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "Exactly! I've got lots of different ideas that I think would work.",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "aey7qs",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "i4j3r1am",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "And I thought maybe you could help me...since I know how you like to draw.",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "d2rtur",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "i4j3r1am",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "It'd be hard for me to make a visual novel alone.",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "m2jdpg",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "sylvie green normal.png",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "9myv6e",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "sylvie green normal.png",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "xchrul",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "11tg9uyk",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "Well, sure! I can try. I just hope I don't disappoint you.",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "mul9zz",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "i4j3r1am",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "You know you could never disappoint me, Sylvie.",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "htedzx",
          "type": "effect",
          "kind": "dissolve",
          "dur": 0.5
        },
        {
          "id": "8ukzt4",
          "type": "jump",
          "scene_id": "q77xtz",
          "transition": "dissolve",
          "_targetLabel": "vns_scene_scMarry"
        },
        {
          "id": "0xy8o4",
          "type": "jump",
          "scene_id": null,
          "_isReturn": true
        }
      ],
      "scene_ids": []
    },
    {
      "id": "68wp9a",
      "label": "Book",
      "bg": null,
      "music": null,
      "events": [
        {
          "id": "pi8wxp",
          "type": "raw",
          "raw_code": "$ book = True"
        },
        {
          "id": "vriz61",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "i4j3r1am",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "It's like an interactive book that you can read on a computer or a console.",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "dvtd8y",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "sylvie green surprised.png",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "14f7tr",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "sylvie green surprised.png",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "ufwdxx",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "11tg9uyk",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "Interactive?",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "86fj30",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "i4j3r1am",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "You can make choices that lead to different events and endings in the story.",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "9xjc0x",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "sylvie green surprised.png",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "zsjylm",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "11tg9uyk",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "So where does the \\\"visual\\\" part come in?",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "intknt",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "i4j3r1am",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "Visual novels have pictures and even music, sound effects, and sometimes voice acting to go along with the text.",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "tob543",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "sylvie green smile.png",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "tjja3h",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "sylvie green smile.png",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "x97o6u",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "11tg9uyk",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "I see! That certainly sounds like fun. I actually used to make webcomics way back when, so I've got lots of story ideas.",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "c01uhd",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "i4j3r1am",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "That's great! So...would you be interested in working with me as an artist?",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "itfauc",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "sylvie green smile.png",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "sc9kfj",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "11tg9uyk",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "I'd love to!",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "aot9aq",
          "type": "effect",
          "kind": "dissolve",
          "dur": 0.5
        },
        {
          "id": "dl8ecx",
          "type": "jump",
          "scene_id": "q77xtz",
          "transition": "dissolve",
          "_targetLabel": "vns_scene_scMarry"
        },
        {
          "id": "lxxsrp",
          "type": "jump",
          "scene_id": null,
          "_isReturn": true
        }
      ],
      "scene_ids": []
    },
    {
      "id": "q77xtz",
      "label": "Marry",
      "bg": "bg club.jpg",
      "music": null,
      "events": [
        {
          "id": "3xi7na",
          "type": "bg",
          "bg": "bg club.jpg"
        },
        {
          "id": "16s05x",
          "type": "effect",
          "kind": "Dissolve",
          "dur": 0.5
        },
        {
          "id": "6ho4pm",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "And so, we become a visual novel creating duo."
        },
        {
          "id": "60zbyt",
          "type": "effect",
          "kind": "Dissolve",
          "dur": 0.5
        },
        {
          "id": "ak0q00",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Over the years, we make lots of games and have a lot of fun making them."
        },
        {
          "id": "1tf4ex",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "We take turns coming up with stories and characters and support each other to make some great games!"
        },
        {
          "id": "fhmqg2",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "And one day..."
        },
        {
          "id": "zq9dfq",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "sylvie blue normal.png",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "jf2afx",
          "type": "effect",
          "kind": "Dissolve",
          "dur": 0.5
        },
        {
          "id": "7m157e",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "sylvie blue normal.png",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "9h5z6p",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "11tg9uyk",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "Hey...",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "s986nn",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "i4j3r1am",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "Yes?",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "bo2aur",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "sylvie blue giggle.png",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "ahjlbe",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "sylvie blue giggle.png",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "jhtl2r",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "11tg9uyk",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "Will you marry me?",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "1b15i8",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "i4j3r1am",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "What? Where did this come from?",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "ku3ovh",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "sylvie blue surprised.png",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "qr6p6l",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "sylvie blue surprised.png",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "lmyscl",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "11tg9uyk",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "Come on, how long have we been dating?",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "hsjxqo",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "i4j3r1am",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "A while...",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "xvq72i",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "sylvie blue normal.png",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "m6z0uk",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "sylvie blue normal.png",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "i6p4kx",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "11tg9uyk",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "These last few years we've been making visual novels together, spending time together, helping each other...",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "nsbfju",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "sylvie blue normal.png",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "jba0bz",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "11tg9uyk",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "I've gotten to know you and care about you better than anyone else. And I think the same goes for you, right?",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "tkngtf",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "i4j3r1am",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "Sylvie...",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "sr21h0",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "sylvie blue giggle.png",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "lj1fdf",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "sylvie blue giggle.png",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "r44otk",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "11tg9uyk",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "But I know you're the indecisive type. If I held back, who knows when you'd propose?",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "qjl138",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "sylvie blue normal.png",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "rqitiy",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "sylvie blue normal.png",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "lilnn8",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "11tg9uyk",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "So will you marry me?",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "g8clop",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "i4j3r1am",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "Of course I will! I've actually been meaning to propose, honest!",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "g571th",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "sylvie blue normal.png",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "blamou",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "11tg9uyk",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "I know, I know.",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "ujm2qc",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "i4j3r1am",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "I guess... I was too worried about timing. I wanted to ask the right question at the right time.",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "smfirm",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "sylvie blue giggle.png",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "3q1ltg",
          "type": "image",
          "image": "sylvie blue giggle.png",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "59j1gc",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "char_id": "11tg9uyk",
          "pose": "neutral",
          "text": "You worry too much. If only this were a visual novel and I could pick an option to give you more courage!",
          "side": "center"
        },
        {
          "id": "9uk62w",
          "type": "effect",
          "kind": "Dissolve",
          "dur": 0.5
        },
        {
          "id": "75qyr0",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "We get married shortly after that."
        },
        {
          "id": "k672bq",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Our visual novel duo lives on even after we're married...and I try my best to be more decisive."
        },
        {
          "id": "4hsuk2",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Together, we live happily ever after even now."
        },
        {
          "id": "ptoqyx",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "{b}Good Ending{/b}."
        },
        {
          "id": "86n92d",
          "type": "jump",
          "scene_id": null,
          "_isReturn": true
        }
      ],
      "scene_ids": []
    },
    {
      "id": "nn5hep",
      "label": "Later",
      "bg": null,
      "music": null,
      "events": [
        {
          "id": "g1xhsb",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "I can't get up the nerve to ask right now. With a gulp, I decide to ask her later."
        },
        {
          "id": "qc8yao",
          "type": "effect",
          "kind": "Dissolve",
          "dur": 0.5
        },
        {
          "id": "1x1zvq",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "But I'm an indecisive person."
        },
        {
          "id": "0sy460",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "I couldn't ask her that day and I end up never being able to ask her."
        },
        {
          "id": "9p0gbn",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "I guess I'll never know the answer to my question now..."
        },
        {
          "id": "sl9j7q",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "{b}Bad Ending{/b}."
        },
        {
          "id": "u877ig",
          "type": "jump",
          "scene_id": null,
          "_isReturn": true
        }
      ],
      "scene_ids": []
    }
  ],
